# Survey video. The drone clip is 607 MB (the lossless remux of the original)
# and GitHub rejects anything over 100 MB, so the videos are served from
# local-server / object storage rather than committed. The detection JSON and
# route GeoJSON beside them are small and ARE committed, so the map, chart and
# defect list work on a deploy even when the video itself is absent.
public/nsv/*.mp4
public/live_demo_samples/*.mp4
